posts.text:
Americans can’t fuel their cars on wishful thinking and Trump’s empty promises.

@SenateDems have forced 13 votes on Iran War Powers Resolutions to end Trump’s war.

And we’ll keep fighting for as long as it takes to bring our troops home, lower costs, and end this illegal, unnecessary war.

